WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,220
As long as you can lend me medicine to save your life, I'll do it first

2
00:00:05,220 --> 00:00:06,820
If you can leave, come here by yourself

3
00:00:06,820 --> 00:00:09,220
I can sit on the mountain for wound suturing and emergency treatment

4
00:00:09,220 --> 00:00:10,820
I'm too hurt

5
00:00:10,820 --> 00:00:13,620
Hemostatic drugs and antibiotics are urgently needed

6
00:00:13,620 --> 00:00:16,620
Please lend me medicine to save my life

7
00:00:16,620 --> 00:00:18,020
Dr. Zhou is here

8
00:00:18,020 --> 00:00:21,420
We have a medical facility in the entire building.

9
00:00:21,420 --> 00:00:24,140
These medicines should be available in the medical space

10
00:00:24,140 --> 00:00:26,140
But Aunt Lin is greedy by nature

11
00:00:26,140 --> 00:00:28,690
Better to keep it for your own use

12
00:00:28,690 --> 00:00:30,290
I am the person in charge of the neighborhood committee

13
00:00:30,290 --> 00:00:32,490
Everyone must hand over all supplies and medicines immediately

14
00:00:32,490 --> 00:00:33,890
Allocated by me

15
00:00:33,890 --> 00:00:36,490
It’s been two days since I ran out of grains

16
00:00:36,490 --> 00:00:38,090
Who has food?

17
00:00:38,090 --> 00:00:40,490
I paid a high price to buy it

18
00:00:40,490 --> 00:00:42,290
I still have a few packs of instant noodles on hand

19
00:00:42,290 --> 00:00:44,490
Sold a pack for 1,000 yuan

20
00:00:44,490 --> 00:00:46,490
I'll pay two thousand yuan a bag

21
00:00:46,490 --> 00:00:48,890
I'll cover all the instant noodles in your hand

22
00:00:48,890 --> 00:00:50,690
Truly absurd apocalyptic rules

23
00:00:50,690 --> 00:00:52,290
From this moment on, Xumu officially opened
